    Add Voice Activity Detection (VAD) configs to whisperCpp (#6838)
    
    This PR adds configurations for the Voice Activity Detection (VAD) of
    WhisperC++, see
    https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp?tab=readme-ov-file#voice-activity-detection-vad.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    1. Install WhisperC++ and configure Opencast according to
    https://docs.opencast.org/r/17.x/admin/#configuration/transcription.configuration/whispercpp/#enable-whisperc-engine.
    2. Configure VAD in
    `org.opencastproject.speechtotext.impl.engine.WhisperCppEngine.cfg`
    3. Upload a video and see the generated subtitles in the player.
    
    
